### darwin llvm+gfortran | arch x86_64
  ERROR PconsValueError: gfortran cannot retarget the CPU to 'x86_64' by flag. Use a cross preset (e.g. linux_cross(triple=...)) or a cross toolchain instead; see docs/presets.md.
### darwin llvm+gfortran | cross aarch64-linux-gnu
  ERROR PconsValueError: Cross preset 'linux-aarch64' targets triple 'aarch64-linux-gnu', but gfortran selects targets by binary, not by flag. Provide cross-compiler commands in the preset's tool_cmds (e.g. fc=aarch64-linux-gnu-gfortran), or use flang, which retargets via --target.
